COMMENT     REFSEQ INFORMATION: The reference sequence is identical to
            BDCL00000000.1.
            The Nocardia rhamnosiphila NBRC 108938 whole genome shotgun (WGS)
            project has the project accession NZ_BDCL00000000.  This version of
            the project (01) has the accession number NZ_BDCL01000000, and
            consists of sequences BDCL01000001-BDCL01000120.
            
            
            Strain NBRC 108938 available from NBRC culture collection
            (http://www.nite.go.jp/en/nbrc/index.html).
            
            The NBRC Whole Genome Shotgun Project aims to provide 'reference
            genomes' of NBRC culture collection strains for identifying useful
            genes for taxonomic classification, risk/safety assessment, and
            industrial application, and for understanding the structure and
            evolution of microbial genomes.
            (http://www.nite.go.jp/en/nbrc/genome/project/wgs/
            project_wgs2.html).
            
